<title>SOUTH KOREA: POSCO in $120 mln Indonesian j/v.</title>
<headline>POSCO in $120 mln Indonesian j/v.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pohang Iron and Steel Co Ltd (POSCO) of South Korea said on Wednesday it had signed an agreement to build a $120 million joint venture cold-rolled stainless steel mill with Indonesia's PT Metro.</p>
</text>
